    <translators/>
    <note>Beginning (title + formula of veneration)anden+d (ca. one line) are missing. The text appears in three blocks: Ka-Na 12b3-19b4 (correspon+ding to D 185a1-188a6 +168a2-171b6, Q 461b3-468a5 + 444a2-448a3) immediately follows the first part of text 24.6; its beginning is marked by a note in dbu med: 'di nas nor ba yin 'di'i stod ma gi na bzhugs; at the end it shows the concluding rdzogs sho, however without stating the title. Ka-Na 24a1-25a8 (correspon+ding to D 171b6-173a3, Q 448a3-449b2) follows after text 24.8andends again with the concluding rdzogs sho (without stating the title) + dang zhus. Ka-Ma 8a1-19a5 (corresponding to D 173a3-185a1, Q 449b2-461b3) follows text 24.10andmerges into the secon+d part of text 24.6 (Ka-Ma 19a5). The entries for L 233and234 in PAGEL 1996, "Li yul byuL nas li'i rgyal po rabs drug"and"Li yul gyi lo rgyus" are not titles, but passages from the text itself. In L, the same parts of the text are missing as in Go.</note>
